# Compact build output. The generated contract module is committed (116 KB) so
# the off-chain circuit tests run on a clean checkout without installing the
# Compact toolchain. The proving/verifier keys and ZKIR are not (14 MB) — they
# are only needed to submit a transaction, and `pnpm contracts:build` rebuilds
# everything.
contracts/managed/proofpass/keys/
contracts/managed/proofpass/zkir/
contracts/managed/proofpass/contract/index.js.map
client/public/compact/
